OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fdamp start to the night with some rain
OL,7,Fshowers, with little change likely
OL,8,Fthrough the night. Some mist and fog
OL,9,Freturning, mostly across higher
OL,10,Fground. Light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FMisty start. A band of light
OL,13,Frain and drizzle affecting most areas
OL,14,Fwill probably remain slow-moving
OL,15,Facross the region. Possibly turning
OL,16,Fdrier later and winds remaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
