OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FTurning
OL,6,Flargely dry with some sunshine Friday
OL,7,Fand Saturday but a chance of coastal
OL,8,Fshowers. Temperatures near or below
OL,9,Fnormal. Mostly light winds. Cloudier
OL,10,Fwith rain likely later on Sunday.
